Standards-Version: 4.0.0
Homepage: https://github.com/dustinkirkland/petname
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/dustinkirkland/petname

Package: patname
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: man-db
Description: RFC1178 implementation to generate pronouncable, perhaps even memorable, "pat names"
 This utility will generate "pat names", consisting of a random
 combination of an adverb, adjective, and "patrick".  These are
 useful for unique hostnames, VMs, or containers, for instance.
